actions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4964540783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121080#issuecomment-4964540783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121080","id":4964540783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ-jhbw","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T01:33:29Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T01:33:29Z","body":"> Now that this styling was introduced to the 2/3D bars, I noticed that the contextual bar has a similar but different style, without the borders:\r\n> \r\n> <img alt=\"Screenshot_20260708_223312\" width=\"93\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/30739239/619151282-a0d46c35-2527-4362-8349-a04acf938c57.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..YMiqmSTNQ-eByBY4uhYQZHvSFZzDfXfkR1-WMHD3Vv0\">\r\n> \r\n> It actually makes me wonder if the current style could follow this one instead. It would help with the extra thickness it gives to bars, and with the highlight of non-grouped buttons being stretched.\r\n\r\nDid a little test with this. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4551fe94-253e-4c3f-8c75-9ef02bfe9134\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/35c41fac-b810-4d35-8ed5-de7707a49c9e\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is not bad. I am not sure if I am used to the smaller buttons \"inside\" the button group (like how it is in this PR) or not, but I feel like this is a bit cluttered, especially when multiple are selected like this. It does have the benefit of solving the stretching though.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"180\" height=\"152\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b6e90c-08b0-4cfc-b81d-6d5d84c30943\" />\r\n\r\n--\r\n\r\nI do wanna ask. I should have solved most of extra thickness to the toolbar, at least on my setup, are these (and the game bar PR) still thick for you?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4964540783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4964728238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121080#issuecomment-4964728238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121080","id":4964728238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ-u9rg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-14T02:11:06Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T02:11:06Z","body":"> I do wanna ask. I should have solved most of extra thickness to the toolbar, at least on my setup, are these (and the game bar PR) still thick for you?\r\n\r\nWhile it got slimmer, it still larger than most bars across the editor. Ideally, all bars should match size.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4964728238/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5310743037","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121080#issuecomment-5310743037","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121080","id":5310743037,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABPIuB_Q","user":{"login":"jaydensipe","id":47132280,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MTMyMjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47132280?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe","html_url":"https://github.com/jaydensipe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaydensipe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url"